[F]Am I to find a [F]shallow grave [F]on the frozen [Gm]home
[Eb]If ever I should [Bb]make it back, [D]oh I will never roam [Gm]will roam
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[Gm]The wind she [Gm]makes a fickle [Gm]friend, soon her heart [D7]had turned
